<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<resources>
    <string name="app_name">Easy Voice</string>

    <!--
      DO NOT OVERRIDE androidx's `default_popup_window_title` HERE. It was tried
      on 2026-09-04 and it made things worse, which is the whole reason this note
      exists.

      Every Compose Popup titles its own Android window with that resource, and
      the library's value is the words "Pop-Up Window". Overriding it with an
      EMPTY string does not remove the announcement: it removes the NAME, and a
      screen reader then falls back to describing the window itself. The owner
      heard the result immediately: "sub panel", then the activity, then the
      package name. A window with no title is worse than a window with a dull
      one.

      The library's own wording is what ships. Owner, 2026-09-04: "compose mein
      to already hota hai na ... bhale vah to bolta hi rahata hai, to aapko yah
      extra fix karne ki jarurat hi nahin hai."
    -->
</resources>
